  "container": "<div class=\"two-columns-left\" id=\"container\">\n<main class=\"main\" id=\"main\" role=\"main\">\n<header class=\"page-header pad-container\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WebPageElement\">\n<h1 class=\"page-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">Category: <span>Resource</span></h1> </header><!-- .page-header -->\n<div class=\"content-masonry\" id=\"content-masonry\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Blog\">\n<article class=\"hentry post-1723 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-research-results category-resource\" id=\"post-1723\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/BlogPosting\">\n<div class=\"article-inner\">\n<header class=\"entry-header\">\n<div class=\"entry-meta beforetitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\" itemprop=\"headline\"><a href=\"/electronic-devices-as-correlates-of-sedentary-behavior-and-screen-time-among-diverse-low-income-adolescents-during-the-school-year-and-summer-time/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\" rel=\"bookmark\">Electronic Devices as Correlates of Sedentary Behavior and Screen Time Among Diverse Low-Income Adolescents During the School Year and Summer Time</a></h2>\n<div class=\"entry-meta aftertitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n<div class=\"entry-summary\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<p>Electronic Devices as Correlates of Sedentary Behavior and Screen Time Among Diverse Low-Income Adolescents During the School Year and Summer Time By: James F. Sallis, Terry L. Conway, Kelli L. Cain, Carrie Geremia, Edith Bonilla, Chad Spoon, University of California San Diego Since 2001 the American Academy of Pediatrics has \u2026</p>\n</div><!-- .entry-summary -->\n<div class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/ty